{"id":"e1d0bc84062e5d0c","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code.md","title":"三个计数器的互异素数幂编码","display":"df-prime-exponent-counter-code — 三个计数器的互异素数幂编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code","aliases":["73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code"],"display":"df-prime-exponent-counter-code — 三个计数器的互异素数幂编码","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.5.4, Theorem 8.15, print pp. 360–361; PDF pp. 382–383","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prime-exponent-counter-code — 三个计数器的互异素数幂编码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.5.4, Theorem 8.15, print pp. 360–361; PDF pp. 382–383"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j,k,i&#39;,j&#39;,k&#39;\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j,k,i&#39;,j&#39;,k&#39;\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf c=(i,j,k)\">\\(\\mathbf c=(i,j,k)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(E:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> 为下式定义的编码函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(\\mathbf c)\">\\(E(\\mathbf c)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(i,j,k)\">\\(E(i,j,k)\\)</span> 表示同一次三元组调用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E(i,j,k)\\coloneqq2^i3^j5^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E(i,j,k)\\coloneqq2^i3^j5^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E(i,j,k)=E(i&#39;,j&#39;,k&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow(i,j,k)=(i&#39;,j&#39;,k&#39;),\\qquad\ni=0\\Longleftrightarrow2\\nmid E(i,j,k),\\quad\nj=0\\Longleftrightarrow3\\nmid E(i,j,k),\\quad\nk=0\\Longleftrightarrow5\\nmid E(i,j,k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E(i,j,k)=E(i&#39;,j&#39;,k&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow(i,j,k)=(i&#39;,j&#39;,k&#39;),\\qquad\ni=0\\Longleftrightarrow2\\nmid E(i,j,k),\\quad\nj=0\\Longleftrightarrow3\\nmid E(i,j,k),\\quad\nk=0\\Longleftrightarrow5\\nmid E(i,j,k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E(i+1,j,k)=2E(i,j,k),\\qquad\ni&gt;0\\Longrightarrow E(i-1,j,k)=E(i,j,k)/2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E(i+1,j,k)=2E(i,j,k),\\qquad\ni&gt;0\\Longrightarrow E(i-1,j,k)=E(i,j,k)/2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>唯一分解保证单射；其他两个分量的加减与乘除 3、5 同理。零向量编码为 1，不是 0；二计数器模拟必须先把主计数器初始化为 1。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i,j,k,i',j',k'\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf c=(i,j,k)","display":false},{"tex":"E:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"E(\\mathbf c)","display":false},{"tex":"E(i,j,k)","display":false},{"tex":"E(i,j,k)\\coloneqq2^i3^j5^k.","display":true},{"tex":"E(i,j,k)=E(i',j',k')\\Longleftrightarrow(i,j,k)=(i',j',k'),\\qquad\ni=0\\Longleftrightarrow2\\nmid E(i,j,k),\\quad\nj=0\\Longleftrightarrow3\\nmid E(i,j,k),\\quad\nk=0\\Longleftrightarrow5\\nmid E(i,j,k).","display":true},{"tex":"E(i+1,j,k)=2E(i,j,k),\\qquad\ni>0\\Longrightarrow E(i-1,j,k)=E(i,j,k)/2.","display":true}],"bytes":1471,"backlinks":[{"id":"bfaeda4e7d4809c2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code|三个计数器的互异素数幂编码]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"c955310a21272c92","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}